10. How do you bypass Xss-protection header to exploit Xss.

That header is deprecated and is ignored by most modern browsers. During a penetration test, I focus on finding actual XSS vulnerabilities by checking input handling,
output encoding, DOM manipulation, and CSP. If the application is vulnerable, the absence or presence of the X-XSS-Protection header doesn't provide meaningful protection in modern browsers.

